[{"title":"郭里南太守见过，即送往兰州","author":"李宪噩","text":"忆我悬弧辰，祝念在四方。\n读书缅往迹，壮志常慨慷。\n无由致身远，空负七尺长。\n里井闲岁月，奄忽四十霜。\n故人帝都来，舆马惊村庄。\n昔为同学友，今佩太守章。\n别离二十载，遍游雍与梁。\n屡嗟蜀相功，几回吊秦皇。\n朝当出玉门，熊首指敦煌。\n逝将从子去，行行至洛阳。\n逶迤过商山，遂经渭水旁。\n渭水绕长安，自昔争名场。\n所求如未遂，贤达亦感伤。\n感伤可奈何，绝塞观大荒。\n单于遗垒在，瀚海何茫茫。\n遐览一挥涕，沈抱庶可扬？\n负疴不获俱，坐令悲穷乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14870,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"青州馆对月，忆叔白、子乔南行","author":"李宪噩","text":"一片家山月，分程照远游。\n何时渡湘水？\n今夜宿青州。\n独卧未安枕，对吟应在舟。\n那堪两地恨？\n并入北堂愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14871,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿小村，怀叔白、子乔南中","author":"李宪噩","text":"独宿小村夜，乍无州郡哗。\n依偎侍童小，离别故人赊。\n雨歇尚愁路，月圆应到家。\n远人岂知此？\n举酒向天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14872,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道旁礼佛，题山寺壁","author":"李宪噩","text":"道旁还礼拜，稽首泪先零。\n天定若无改，佛悲何有灵？\n祗教除妄想，应惜枉劳形。\n法力自深广，归家惟奉经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14873,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"死归生","author":"李宪噩","text":"死归生，舍生拼死来求名。\n炎天日午烁冈阪，里门未出何曾经？\n况兼徒步少车马，中乾外强烦郁并。\n竟死道旁鲜弟兄，中野暴骸行人惊。\n昨夜山雨秋风晴，丧车载归牛铎鸣。\n生时与我不相识，殁归同宿晓同征。\n知君珠玉罗万斛，积未得吐目岂瞑？\n道左吊君慰君灵，我亦求试来齐城，一言未献返乡程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14874,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"李宪噩","text":"才望春晴却又阴，梅花畏冷不开心。\n北堂侍疾年垂暮，万里南天无信音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14875,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭王东溪","author":"李宪噩","text":"贫贱仍无寿，贤人自昔悲。\n巷穷吊车绝，品重贩夫知。\n农子自于野，病妻空守帷。\n堆床破书里，有我寄怀诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14876,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送三岁儿筠龄归圹","author":"李宪噩","text":"正得还真自在休，百年托体亦山邱。\n略尝世味如斯足，底用劳生到白头？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14877,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪书来，得悉子乔近事，并言彼中十月桃放","author":"李宪噩","text":"季子鸣琴处，山桃几树新。\n霜村方爱日，花县已逢春。\n自见栖南雀，还教诧北人。\n祗今寒食近，嫩惢未全伸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14878,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡黄河","author":"李宪噩","text":"我行大梁道，日夕黄河渡。\n河水浩漫漫，故乡在何处？\n风起广沙岸，烟昏远野树。\n孤舟乘危波，惝恍不敢顾。\n游子杳天末，谁识南荒路？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14879,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尉氏县","author":"李宪噩","text":"朔气乘风傍晚晴，啼雅流水夕阳明。\n树边寒色动乡思，料峭归人暮入城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14880,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶县对月，寄东桂生徒","author":"李宪噩","text":"东斋孤月冷凄凄，几个寒雅树上啼。\n寄语诸生休怅望，行人已过大梁西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14881,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过古宛州，感孟襄阳《南归阻雪》篇","author":"李宪噩","text":"志伸盛意气，揽辔轻四方。\n志屈颓意气，泥情恋穷乡。\n气盛万里近，气颓百里长。\n不然宛与许，故自逼襄阳。\n胡为孟夫子，到此多叹伤。\n况我家东海，跋涉趋汴梁。\n汴渠达汝颖，遂以涉湖湘。\n湖湘何足道？\n行复极炎荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14882,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过天门县，留示县尹匡淑辰","author":"李宪噩","text":"南游浩荡杳乡关，尚有故人江汉闲。\n卧病孤舟不相遇，片帆竟过天门山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14883,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孤舟","author":"李宪噩","text":"孤舟乡梦觉，残月空江落。\n到晓不闻声，风动系船索。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14884,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长沙感贾生","author":"李宪噩","text":"含愁渡湘水，况复负疴身。\n舟泊长沙郡，心怜失意人。\n寒城又斜日，旧宅只荒榛。\n往事风烟杳，空余志未伸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14885,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湘口感刘子厚","author":"李宪噩","text":"素耽子厚诗，心驰永与柳。\n田居侍亲老，远役吾何有？\n蓦来非驱迫，万里西南走。\n洞庭几惊魂，岳麓重回首。\n竟到迁客地，潆洄古湘口。\n二水停风雷，澄浤无纤垢。\n南涧在何处？\n遗迹应不朽。\n西山望见之，披寻须我友。\n如何多叹嗟？\n转与昔人偶。\n名区不遑览，忧心时抱疚。\n别离岁当金，迢递月在丑。\n柳州行复经，吾将过南斗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14886,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"日落","author":"李宪噩","text":"日落谷风息，山高江月斜。\n孤舟少邻舫，深树是谁家？\n客路年还至，乡园雪正赊。\n宁知小儿女，还解忆天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14887,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"全州登陆，宿唐家司，闻湘水声","author":"李宪噩","text":"千里湘流送客程，漓江未入欲分行。\n多情山店复相值，夜半侧闻离恨声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14888,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"溶江道中","author":"李宪噩","text":"一自别湘水，大溶还小溶。\n有村皆隔竹，无径不由松。\n云积岭头涧，日沈山外峰。\n中华知己远，时与峒苗逢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14889,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"失题","author":"李宪噩","text":"江春入旧年，北客趁蛮船。\n素业留齐域，晴光换粤天。\n无书家更远，有志岁频迁。\n不欲窥明镜，恐丝生鬓边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14890,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其一 岑城","author":"李宪噩","text":"蛮州历劫瘴烟清，獞峒猺山春色明。\n一自莲塘留谶语，千秋遗恨在岑城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14891,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其二 洒然亭","author":"李宪噩","text":"洒然亭子古榕闲，日见云生大瓮山。\n不忿雄文成绝笔，却教粉壁泪痕斑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14892,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其三 钟氏园","author":"李宪噩","text":"钟家池馆好风光，万里偏知结客场。\n独自寻来还寂寞，竹闲蛮鸟断人肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14893,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其四 易使桥","author":"李宪噩","text":"江上思归折柳条，夕阳山畔雨潇潇。\n清歌进酒人何在？\n肠断春城易使桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14894,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其五 孝子祠","author":"李宪噩","text":"日暮秋风孝子祠，当时拜祷有新诗。\n神光不照连枝树，空使慈乌夜夜悲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14895,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其六 清风亭","author":"李宪噩","text":"亭上山风清客心，瀑泉幽冷和鸣琴。\n可怜已作广陵散，无复人间听此音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14896,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪悲叔白七首 其七 望冈楼","author":"李宪噩","text":"破除客闷此登楼，叠叠云山无尽愁。\n逝者已含终古恨，病躯何事滞边州？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14897,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七月七日，与子乔会岑诗人于钟氏园，分韵得十蒸，去年叔白有此会","author":"李宪噩","text":"新欢意方接，旧感慨已兴。\n复此双星节，秋云霭然蒸。\n石径聊独游，山亭亦共登。\n览彼红惢异，俯兹碧池澄。\n吾弟幸休暇，政简庶有徵？\n胡为激长恸，往迹不可仍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14898,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清风泉者，岑溪葛仙岩瀑流也。叔白苦爱之。属纩时，命汲泉水濯体以殓，复过其下，悲题四语","author":"李宪噩","text":"苦爱仙岩片石青，寒泉濯罢目方瞑。\n瀑边定有幽魂立，万古千秋倚石听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14899,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西园对月","author":"李宪噩","text":"万里西园月，还应照故乡。\n残乌啼落木，新鬼吊空堂。\n荆树知犹在，松亭宜就荒。\n家书前日到，亲友几人亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14900,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西园示新亭","author":"李宪噩","text":"说罢离愁依旧闲，空园日暮鸟飞还。\n芭蕉过雨声初歇，又见云生叠叠山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14901,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岑溪","author":"李宪噩","text":"更向苍梧外，吾家北海滨。\n入城多怪鸟，编户半流人。\n那识蕉花发，初尝荔子新。\n宁无广闻见，不似故山春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14902,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新理小园亭，示子乔","author":"李宪噩","text":"独无烦剧劳，小营斸蒿莱。\n园亭虽不广，时有山风来。\n且喜栽竹活，昨夜蕉花开。\n县僻官常闲，时复同一杯。\n吾母幸康悦，身世安足怀。\n独为罢弹琴，乐事中还乖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14903,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭林鸣九二首钞一","author":"李宪噩","text":"识君方总角，春宴咏榆钱。\n一别七千里，相知三十年。\n寄书犹未达，此信岂应传？\n哭罢仍疑在，清标尚俨然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14904,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭雨苍舅","author":"李宪噩","text":"苦作临岐约，相要勿久违。\n边城犹未到，泉路却先归。\n去对庭花别，回应墓草围。\n更闻移宁宅，比舍锁双扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14905,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将去岑溪，留别同乡流人艾归","author":"李宪噩","text":"知从北州遣，几载作流人。\n蛮内语偏识，天涯情自亲。\n离乡无贵贱，共客识酸辛。\n莫羡扬帆去，依然粤水滨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14906,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送子乔移官苍梧，至陆云界，去年叔白来迎处","author":"李宪噩","text":"记得经过处，风光少不违。\n来朝又梧郡，前岁别荆扉。\n往路虽云转，此行犹未归。\n所嗟去年雁，还是一行飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14907,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道旁山村","author":"李宪噩","text":"却羡藤州道，闲闲置小村。\n疏林露茅屋，深竹隐柴门。\n鸟路山峰转，渔梁涧水喧。\n宁知瘴烟地，风景逼乡园。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14908,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石桥晚泊","author":"李宪噩","text":"系缆石桥驿，江风生暮寒。\n故乡杳何处，春水月漫漫。\n连岸竹交荫，塞空峰乱攒。\n家人岂知此，祗是向南看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14909,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙岩洞","author":"李宪噩","text":"春晴小江岸，竹里暂停舟。\n忽睹一峰异，下寻双洞幽。\n龙藏云不散，仙去灶还留。\n孤兴无人识，匆匆感触游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14910,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再泊戎墟","author":"李宪噩","text":"又向蛮墟泊，孤舟几往还。\n谁知我名姓，空习此江山。\n镫火海商集，棹歌渔父闲。\n幽居归未得，坐惜鬓毛斑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14911,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送石白水归湘潭","author":"李宪噩","text":"年少楚南客，双亲犹在堂。\n远游虽失计，难得是还乡。\n过陡山连岳，分流水入湘。\n心知北归路，相送意茫茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14912,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送子乔充粤西同考官入省","author":"李宪噩","text":"三十载辛苦，锁闱求赏音。\n每当下笔夜，想得入帘心。\n玉石眼谁别，雪霜头已侵。\n汝行休慢易，此恨古来深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14913,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"下第感汀鹤，和黄生瑸","author":"李宪噩","text":"失意逢孤鹤，偏怜伫野汀。\n高标空自许，清泪有谁听？\n远树雨中暗，暮山江上青。\n不须增怅悒，辽海几人经？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14914,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叔白亡，王蜀子致书相吊，报以叔白所遗洋刀，并《刀赋》，兼寄此诗","author":"李宪噩","text":"人事自不齐，天道宁可问？\n逐逐千庸愚，落落数才俊。\n举眼见成败，谁能识利钝？\n从古抱才士，湮没赍此忿。\n所赖贤者知，犹有千秋论。\n慨为当世惜，不独一身困。\n夭寿数之常，得此可无恨。\n蛮刀不华饰，都市顽铁溷。\n一朝遇有心，倾赀买不吝。\n取以试割切，无物可迎刃。\n遂作感刀赋，自有虹光喷。\n寓物本非留，聊托抒其闷。\n其人苟不朽，此刀何用殉？\n代为知己酬，金错尚无逊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14915,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感叔白为唐尉悲故乡诗示闲云并序","author":"李宪噩","text":"人生无最苦，衰贱故乡别。\n闲时梦已凄，醉后情更热。\n县尉何方人？\n羸瘁头似雪。\n去家二十载，升斗甘腰折。\n谋归身无赀，流转江湖阔。\n并坐有龚生，曾为三年约。\n期逝人不还，挥涕相向说。\n吾弟方纵酒，闻之肝肠绝。\n丈夫非际会，安用久漂泊？\n叹息未及终，精英溘然没。\n其年尉亦亡，往事逐云灭。\n故土良可念，人命等秋箨。\n龚生胡不归？\n吾棹行当发。\n与君趋海乡，鱼虾味不恶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14916,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送阮三老还越乡","author":"李宪噩","text":"借问南游客，乡程路几千？\n言归感白首，忆别是青年。\n过岭初见雪，转江犹换船。\n春风到家日，知傍岁除前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14917,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王熙甫见寄其师叔白哀词，单菱浦为之序，感酬短句，及示菱浦及东斋诸同学","author":"李宪噩","text":"谐情自有偶，不属钗与裙。\n继志自有后，不必儿与孙。\n丈夫奋一世，要使百世闻。\n生或应其声，死或传其神。\n斯人谁不死？\n死身不死人。\n妻子相环哭，但思返其魂。\n魂返宁有术？\n道在灵不泯。\n孰能重斯道？\n千载生如新。\n煌煌古圣训，朋友列五伦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14918,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"李宪噩","text":"不寐听芭蕉，多时未寂寥。\n梦回何处夜？\n蛮雨正潇潇。\n弟病官方累，母衰家更遥。\n炎州霜雪少，应向鬓边饶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14919,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哀岑役陈辉有序","author":"李宪噩","text":"役为县官使，来往报晴雨。\n官清身无衣，妻亡室无侣。\n昨闻死山隩，怀藏书带羽。\n道病不知时，暴骸委豺虎。\n在世急公役，鞭策亦良苦。\n宁谁录微劳，冥冥竟终古。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14920,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送钱少府罢官归姑苏","author":"李宪噩","text":"蛮雨粤江春，春愁有几人。\n共嗟别乡远，偏感去官贫。\n楚泽波还小，吴洲花正新。\n自伤归未得，空送北舟频。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14921,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"徐孝廉松园以豹皮赠子乔，为酬此篇","author":"李宪噩","text":"县宰钦文蔚，山人赠豹皮。\n漫夸千腋集，常重一斑窥。\n品自金钱贵，情同缟纻遗。\n高标矜雾隐，合与素心期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14922,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为龚生作乡墅小景，各系韵语寓怀 其一 待鸿庄","author":"李宪噩","text":"几年归梦滞天涯，故里风光记不差。\n千尺寒河烟树拥，小楼一角是吾家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14923,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为龚生作乡墅小景，各系韵语寓怀 其二 东亭","author":"李宪噩","text":"是谁结搆傍秋溪，应有寒乌月上啼。\n好似吾乡小亭夜，长松疏柳板桥西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14924,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为龚生作乡墅小景，各系韵语寓怀 其三 西林","author":"李宪噩","text":"夹径山松皆十围，碧云香雨昼霏霏。\n村头常是临风醉，几度斜阳送客归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14925,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为龚生作乡墅小景，各系韵语寓怀 其四 十桐井","author":"李宪噩","text":"高敞园窗西面风，世间事不到心中。\n他年记取沧州客，抱瓮闲人号十桐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14926,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"待乡信不至，示闲云","author":"李宪噩","text":"方春送归使，目断瘴江云。\n计日人当返，经秋雁不闻。\n山城荒寂寂，蛮雨昼纷纷。\n此闷复谁共？\n短吟聊示君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14927,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"侄孙洵自故乡至","author":"李宪噩","text":"万里悲乡梦，愁心不暂开。\n猺狼五岭外，生死一身来。\n细问小儿女，频嗟荒竹梅。\n视余颜未改，须鬓已先摧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14928,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬赵玉文秋试济南，阻雨长山客舍，书亡弟叔白题壁句见寄","author":"李宪噩","text":"一从泛江棹，不复问山程。\n野店谁还宿？\n秋宵独有情。\n雨声疏未歇，笔迹俨犹生。\n良友况如此，那堪为弟兄！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14929,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南中食栗，示子乔","author":"李宪噩","text":"新霁复当晓，已寒仍未霜。\n堕风随落叶，晒日迸秋场。\n屋上壶犹菉，田中豆正黄。\n南来都不见，此果似吾乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14930,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"粤中秋兴，用放翁《石镜山前》诗韵，示子乔","author":"李宪噩","text":"榕树风高敛夕辉，南游浩淼此来依。\n漫离乡井谁相迫？\n无与功名底不归。\n江浦秋阴成雨易，山城日暮见人稀。\n田园久别应荒废，手植丹枫皆十围。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14931,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬同乡天河令乔令思移官崇山见寄","author":"李宪噩","text":"知宰极边地，三年鬓已斑。\n对愁犹有子，屡转不离蛮。\n瘴岭天常晦，荒城昼亦关。\n相思情倍切，春梦共家山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14932,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谋归慰母，喜而成句","author":"李宪噩","text":"故乡归路不须愁，北去长江皆顺流。\n好挂双帆渡湘浦，恰逢三月下扬州。\n草堂久别贫犹在，桐圃全荒闲更修。\n且喜慈亲能强饭，海鱼正贱梦初收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":14933,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]